'''Lasan''' was a [[planet]]<ref name="Rise of the Rebels" /> located in the [[Lasan system]] of [[Wild Space]]<ref name="Appendix" /> that was long ago colonized by a group of [[Lasat]] that left their original [[homeworld]] of [[Lira San]].<ref name="Legends of the Lasat" /> The planet was protected by the [[Lasan High Honor Guard]]. During the [[Imperial Era|reign]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], [[Imperial Military|Imperial forces]] led by [[Alexsandr Kallus]] [[Siege of Lasan|devastated]] Lasan and [[Death|killed]] most of its population as a show of Imperial might, though many Lasat still remained on Lira San.<ref name="Rebels Visual Guide" /><ref name="Forged">''[[Forged in Battle]]''</ref> [[Stormtrooper]] [[TK-421]] was stationed on Lasan at one point.<ref name="Of MSE-6 and Men">{{StoryCite|story=Of MSE-6 and Men|book=From a Certain Point of View}}</ref>

{{Planet-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In ''[[Rise of the Rebels]]'', Lasan was established to be located in the [[Outer Rim Territories]],<ref name="Rise of the Rebels" /> though this placing was later changed to [[Wild Space]] in ''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte: The Visual Guide]]''<ref name="Acolyte Visual Guide">''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> and "[[Star Systems of the Galaxy]]."<ref name="Appendix" />

